        "slc_942e4ffed1bb6f74c2572e62b463f53277d4494531a2a3299675e3be33db8eee"
      ],
      "text": "Documented features include a customizable per-project dashboard with widgets, a kanban task board, P2P session sharing, multi-session management, cost/context tracking, a session inspector, and an AI Readiness Score."
    },
